rust-pmg-log-tracker (3.1.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * fix #2091: parser: support the longer, base-52 encoded queue IDs that
    postfix generates with its `enable_long_queue_ids` option, so that the
    Tracking Center can show the affected mails.

  * fix #3657: add an --input-base option to scan a rotated log file series
    with a configurable base path, so that setups logging mail events to a
    dedicated file, like /var/log/mail.log, can be analyzed too. Gzip
    compression of rotated files is detected per file to cope with custom
    logrotate configurations.

 -- Proxmox Support Team <support@proxmox.com>  Wed, 03 Jun 2026 00:20:50 +0200

